- fix: preserve whitespace before a `*` namespace in attribute selectors ([#325](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/325) by [@spokodev](https://github.com/spokodev))
- fix: TypeError on unclosed `[`, `(` and trailing `|` ([#330](https://github.com/postcss/postcss-selector-parser/pull/330) by [@theRizwan](https://github.com/theRizwan))


