> Invert the key/value of an object. Example: `{foo: 'bar'}` ‚Üí `{bar: 'foo'}`

## Install

```
$ npm install invert-kv
```

## Usage

```js
const invertKeyValue = require('invert-kv');

invertKeyValue({foo: 'bar', 'ü¶Ñ': 'üåà'});
//=> {bar: 'foo', 'üåà': 'ü¶Ñ'}
```

