␀␀␀␀ıcs]␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p␀ ␀banlan-supplement-2026-11-20/workspace/packages/banlan-miniapp-frontend/node_modules/hash-sum/changelog.markdownUT␀Æ{˛jÿ5␀kÆ{˛jux␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀# 2.0.0

- Now takes into account result of calling `valueOf` functions when they exist

