␀␀␀␀‰cs]␀␀␀␀¸␀␀¸␀␀e␀ ␀banlan-supplement-2026-11-20/workspace/packages/banlan-miniapp-frontend/node_modules/global/README.mdUT␀ç{˛jfF␀kç{˛jux␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀# global

<!-- [![build status][1]][2]

[![browser support][3]][4] -->

Require global variables

## Example

```js
var global = require("global")
var document = require("global/document")
var window = require("global/window")
```

## Installation

`npm install global`

## Contributors

 - Raynos

