␀␀␀␀ds]␀␀␀␀cf␀␀cf␀␀h␀ ␀banlan-supplement-2026-11-20/workspace/packages/banlan-miniapp-frontend/node_modules/fast-glob/README.mdUT␀‡{˛j4F␀kﬂ{˛jux␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀# fast-glob

> It's a very fast and efficient [glob][glob_definition] library for [Node.js][node_js].

This package provides methods for traversing the file system and returning pathnames that matched a defined set of a specified pattern according to the rules used by the Unix Bash shell with some simplifications, meanwhile results are returned in **arbitrary order**. Quick, simple, effective.

